00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<b>Inside Outside semete</b>

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:51.130
<i>Inside Outside attack</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>いっさいがっさい　抜いて</i>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<b>Issai gassai nuite</b>

00:00:51.130 --> 00:00:53.510
<i>Surpass everything altogether</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<i>誰ひとりも　何ひとつも</i>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:55.720
<b>Dare hitori monani hitotsu mo</b>

00:00:53.510 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>I won’t let no one and nothing go forward</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<i>前を　行かせたくはない</i>

00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:58.180
<b>Mae wo ikasetaku wa nai</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<b>Inside Outside GO! SONIC!!</b>

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:00.560
<i>Inside Outside, Go! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>いっさいがっさい Yes! SONIC!!</i>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<b>Issai gassai Yes! SONIC!!</b>

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.930
<i>Everything altogether Yes! Sonic!!</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>アブナイヨと Have A Nice は似てる</i>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<b>Abunai yo to Have A Nice wa niteru</b>

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:05.910
<i>“Watch out” and “Have a nice” are similar</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>そう　どちらも紙一重なのさ</i>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<b>Soudochira mo kamihitoe na no sa</b>

00:01:05.910 --> 00:01:08.670
<i>That’s right – both are by the skin of your teeth</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>タイクツ脱ぎ捨てて　今すぐかけだせ</i>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<b>Taikutsu nugisuteteima sugu kakedase</b>

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:18.890
<i>Throw boredom away and start running right now</i>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:20.620 --> 00:01:22.390
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<b>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</b>

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:24.640
<i>S, O, N, I, C, GO!</i>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<b>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</b>

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:27.560
<i>GO, GO, GO, GO, LET'S GO!!</i>

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:50.130
Hey!

00:01:50.920 --> 00:01:55.510
I ordered freshly-squeezed orange juice.

00:01:55.510 --> 00:01:59.550
Be quiet! Who cares as long as it's made of fruit?

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:01.180
Bokkun.

00:02:03.640 --> 00:02:06.270
I'll make another one.

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:12.320
By the way, did the Doctor find the next Chaos Emerald?

00:02:13.190 --> 00:02:14.650
Don't play dumb!

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:19.160
He entered this asteroid field because he detected a Chaos Emerald, right?

00:02:19.160 --> 00:02:21.410
I don't know!

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:24.540
Let me go, you stupid devil ogre!

00:02:24.540 --> 00:02:26.660
Stop fighting and answer me!

00:02:28.120 --> 00:02:30.630
We're being attacked from 10 o'clock!

00:02:30.630 --> 00:02:35.090
Detecting multiple heat sources up ahead! There must be spaceships fighting!

00:02:35.460 --> 00:02:37.630
Is it Sonic again?

00:02:37.630 --> 00:02:40.640
They're always getting in my way.

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:43.300
What's that?

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:58.030
Damn! Nothing's working!

00:02:58.030 --> 00:02:59.570
We're finished!

00:02:59.570 --> 00:03:01.990
We're not strong enough to defeat them!

00:03:05.790 --> 00:03:09.710
I'll draw their attention! You focus on attacking the flagship!

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:12.630
Roger!

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:17.550
Pale Bay Leaf.

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:25.810
They're attacking us too!

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:28.350
But we haven't done anything yet!

00:03:28.350 --> 00:03:30.980
We have no choice. Counterattack!

00:03:30.980 --> 00:03:31.940
Shadow!

00:03:34.690 --> 00:03:38.780
Don't chase them too far. Just get rid of them.

00:04:03.340 --> 00:04:05.300
The Black Wind...

00:04:05.300 --> 00:04:06.550
Who's that?

00:04:06.550 --> 00:04:08.930
He's destroying the fighters without using any weapons!

00:04:08.930 --> 00:04:10.100
Is he on our side?

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:13.480
All ships, help him! Formation C on the double!

00:04:15.980 --> 00:04:19.110
There's no point in continuing this battle.

00:04:19.110 --> 00:04:20.280
We're retreating.

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:21.280
Roger.

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:23.030
All fighters, retreat.

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:26.320
Keep communication channels at pattern B.

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:29.410
Continue our plan.

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:34.810
Episode 68

00:04:29.810 --> 00:04:34.810
Above a Destroyed Planet

00:04:39.300 --> 00:04:41.260
Thank you!

00:04:41.260 --> 00:04:46.050
There's no need to thank me. I can defeat the Metarex easily.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:48.350
She's cute.

00:04:48.350 --> 00:04:52.640
I'm jealous that they get to have her as their leader!

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:57.610
Totally! We have to work our tails off for a selfish boss everyday!

00:05:06.110 --> 00:05:08.830
That's our planet.

00:05:09.660 --> 00:05:15.920
Our planet looks like this because the Metarex stole our Planet Egg a long time ago.

00:05:16.670 --> 00:05:21.880
We're going to keep fighting until we restore our planet!

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:30.140
Just as I predicted.

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:34.480
There's a Chaos Emerald somewhere on this planet.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:37.150
I'm counting on you, Shadow.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:39.310
I know.

00:05:39.310 --> 00:05:45.190
Be discreet so that the bat woman doesn't find out.

00:05:45.190 --> 00:05:47.740
What are you two talking about?

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:50.580
I hope he doesn't find out...

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:56.830
If you're going to search for the Chaos Emerald, you'll naturally need my help.

00:05:58.370 --> 00:06:01.960
Don't take your eyes off that bat woman.

00:06:09.640 --> 00:06:14.470
Why do you keep following Eggman's orders? Is it because he's the grandson of your creator?

00:06:14.470 --> 00:06:19.190
We then flew to Space Colony ARK.

00:06:19.440 --> 00:06:23.690
Yes. ARK was filled with memories of Maria.

00:06:23.690 --> 00:06:26.690
So you're just following orders again.

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:29.160
You're no ultimate life form!

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:30.660
Shadow!

00:06:34.290 --> 00:06:37.830
Your name is Shadow, isn't it?

00:06:37.830 --> 00:06:40.580
Dr. Eggman told me.

00:06:40.830 --> 00:06:41.880
Yeah.

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:44.920
Your battle was amazing!

00:06:44.920 --> 00:06:48.170
You defeated the Metarex all by yourself!

00:06:48.170 --> 00:06:50.890
I can't believe what I saw!

00:06:52.390 --> 00:06:55.770
So your home is in another galaxy?

00:06:55.770 --> 00:06:57.560
What kind of place is it?

00:06:58.100 --> 00:06:59.480
Home...

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:03.940
I'm sorry. I talk too much.

00:07:03.940 --> 00:07:07.320
Don't let it bother you. He's always like that.

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:08.650
Really?

00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:17.620
All the guys I ever meet are ignorant idiots.

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:22.040
I just wanted to thank you.

00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:24.790
I admire your strength.

00:07:24.790 --> 00:07:27.050
You're like the Black Wind.

00:07:27.510 --> 00:07:29.300
Black Wind?

00:07:32.300 --> 00:07:37.850
He's a legendary hero who fought against evil to protect the people. Then he vanished like the wind.

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:44.150
It's a fairy tale from when our planet was still normal.

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:46.070
But now...

00:07:46.070 --> 00:07:46.900
Shadow?

00:07:46.900 --> 00:07:49.190
I'm no hero.

00:07:49.190 --> 00:07:52.950
Shadow, she said that it was fairy tale.

00:07:52.950 --> 00:07:57.120
You should also stop thinking that I'm someone that I'm not.

00:08:03.580 --> 00:08:07.550
We would've been in big trouble if you didn't come along!

00:08:07.550 --> 00:08:09.590
We owe you our lives!

00:08:10.970 --> 00:08:14.340
Then don't hold back and keep showering us with your gratitude!

00:08:14.340 --> 00:08:17.180
You operate that huge ship?

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:23.900
We can operate it because Dr. Eggman built an excellent machine.

00:08:23.900 --> 00:08:28.020
Leave the Metarex to us!

00:08:28.020 --> 00:08:31.400
Does that mean you're going to keep fighting alongside us?

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:36.740
That's awesome! With you on our side, we can defeat the Metarex!

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:41.500
We don't have to suffer in battle anymore!

00:08:41.500 --> 00:08:44.790
Ahem, wait a second.

00:08:44.790 --> 00:08:48.040
We have our own mission.

00:08:48.040 --> 00:08:51.420
We can't stay here forever.

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:54.220
So you were all talk?

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:57.090
We've been risking our lives in battle!

00:08:57.090 --> 00:08:58.760
Leon, that's enough.

00:08:58.760 --> 00:09:01.850
You think we're a small-time resistance group and look down on us!

00:09:01.850 --> 00:09:07.440
We used to live in a big city and had a good life too!

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:11.690
We used to rule an empire that consisted of many planets!

00:09:11.690 --> 00:09:17.240
They'll never understand how it feels to fight generation after generation!

00:09:19.910 --> 00:09:21.200
What's wrong?

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:28.290
Chaos Emerald?

00:09:28.290 --> 00:09:30.040
I've never heard of it.

00:09:30.040 --> 00:09:35.260
Were there any meteor impacts or comet sightings recently?

00:09:35.260 --> 00:09:36.760
Meteor...

00:09:36.760 --> 00:09:37.720
Wait a sec!

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:42.180
A little while ago, I heard that something fell out of the sky.

00:09:42.180 --> 00:09:44.770
It was supposedly a white gem-like thing.

00:09:44.770 --> 00:09:45.940
That's it!

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:49.060
It should be at the mineral mine.

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:51.320
Okay, I'll take you there.

00:09:53.110 --> 00:09:54.320
Leon?

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:59.410
Molly, can you do me a favor?

00:09:59.410 --> 00:10:03.490
Can you bring me a disc from the mine's administration office?

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:05.000
Here's the key to the locker.

00:10:05.290 --> 00:10:09.080
What do you intend to do with that old program disc?

00:10:09.080 --> 00:10:14.340
I think I can create a new system based on the old version.

00:10:15.210 --> 00:10:16.670
Okay.

00:10:25.180 --> 00:10:27.100
I have no other choice...

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:42.070
I'm sorry you had to see that.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:46.580
I know it's not easy when you always have to keep fighting.

00:10:46.830 --> 00:10:50.960
I heard that this planet was flourishing a long time ago.

00:10:52.080 --> 00:10:54.590
It was long ago before I was born.

00:10:54.590 --> 00:10:57.170
Before the Metarex arrived.

00:10:57.550 --> 00:11:00.430
This was a rich and powerful planet.

00:11:00.430 --> 00:11:03.510
They say we were close to conquering the entire galaxy.

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:09.690
We fought countless wars against other planets, conquering and dominating them.

00:11:10.730 --> 00:11:14.900
But now, we're about to be conquered.

00:11:15.980 --> 00:11:19.030
It seems you only have your pride left.

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:22.110
Pride that says you were powerful in the past.

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:25.330
It may be over for us.

00:11:25.330 --> 00:11:28.620
Everyone is tired of fighting a losing war.

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:31.080
And this planet continues to erode.

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:38.340
You don't have to force yourself to keep fighting. You can flee.

00:11:38.340 --> 00:11:39.340
Thanks.

00:11:39.340 --> 00:11:43.930
But this is our home. We don't want to abandon it.

00:11:45.850 --> 00:11:48.890
If I only had his power...

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:52.350
I would be able to protect this planet.

00:12:23.380 --> 00:12:24.970
I'll handle this!

00:12:35.690 --> 00:12:36.900
This way!

00:12:39.570 --> 00:12:44.530
You tend to step in front in order to protect your teammates.

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:46.870
That's not a good habit.

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:49.080
If you die, you lose everything.

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:53.210
Someone will carry on my dream.

00:12:54.870 --> 00:12:57.840
Let's hurry! The mine is right there!

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:05.050
Dream? Sounds more like she's clinging to her past.

00:13:05.050 --> 00:13:10.520
If that's the path she chose, we have no right to say anything.

00:13:10.970 --> 00:13:15.940
That girl reminds me of you.

00:13:17.730 --> 00:13:19.820
I'm not like her.

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:22.190
How do you know for sure?

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:26.200
I can't choose my own path.

00:13:44.920 --> 00:13:47.720
There it is! A Chaos Emerald!

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:50.720
I'll hold on to it.

00:13:50.720 --> 00:13:54.640
Sheesh, I'm not gonna try to steal it now!

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:55.600
Oh really?

00:13:55.600 --> 00:13:57.190
What do you mean by that?

00:13:57.190 --> 00:13:59.810
Umm, here it is!

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:16.370
What?

00:14:16.370 --> 00:14:18.920
The locker was rigged with a bomb.

00:14:19.420 --> 00:14:21.340
That was deliberate.

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.340
Why?

00:14:27.430 --> 00:14:31.010
Leon tried to kill me?

00:14:31.010 --> 00:14:32.470
Can it be?

00:14:36.560 --> 00:14:38.020
Metarex!

00:14:44.610 --> 00:14:47.490
Doctor, do you read me? Doctor!

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:51.370
We fell for his trap.

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:54.620
He separated us from the others and tried to kill us with the bomb.

00:14:54.620 --> 00:14:57.000
Then the Metarex will finish off Eggman.

00:14:57.000 --> 00:14:59.460
No, that's impossible!

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:05.510
Because that means Leon was communicating with the Metarex!

00:15:07.340 --> 00:15:10.510
We've also confirmed the explosion.

00:15:10.510 --> 00:15:13.300
Everything is proceeding as planned.

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:20.600
You promised that we would live if I handed over Eggman.

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:25.530
Hand over who?

00:15:25.530 --> 00:15:31.200
I sensed something weird was going on, and now I know.

00:15:31.200 --> 00:15:32.780
Freeze!

00:15:35.540 --> 00:15:38.750
Are you Dark Oak's henchman?

00:15:38.750 --> 00:15:44.920
Exactly. I'm Pale Bay Leaf, one of the four Metarex bosses.

00:15:45.880 --> 00:15:53.220
You were planning to get rid of the resistance and myself in one fell swoop, but you can't catch me that easily.

00:15:53.220 --> 00:15:55.140
Stop ignoring me!

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:05.730
Dr. Eggman!

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:08.070
Good timing!

00:16:11.700 --> 00:16:13.030
Molly!

00:16:14.030 --> 00:16:16.280
If you go back now, you'll be killed.

00:16:17.740 --> 00:16:24.380
If your comrades are planning to surrender to the Metarex, what are you going to do?

00:16:26.420 --> 00:16:29.090
Molly, please come with us!

00:16:29.090 --> 00:16:30.920
At least we're on your side!

00:16:31.170 --> 00:16:33.090
I'll change their minds!

00:16:37.470 --> 00:16:38.680
Molly!

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:47.650
You can't convince them. They rigged that trap.

00:16:47.650 --> 00:16:49.780
They knew what they were doing.

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:52.990
Shadow?

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:54.910
I'll go.

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:59.790
If she dies, there will be no one left to carry out her dream.

00:17:08.920 --> 00:17:13.590
Don't let them get away! We have to capture them in order to join the Metarex!

00:17:15.800 --> 00:17:18.300
How selfish!

00:17:18.300 --> 00:17:21.350
E-3000, play with them!

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:36.820
That was easy!

00:17:36.820 --> 00:17:38.450
It's like playing darts!

00:17:51.050 --> 00:17:53.260
I'm revising our plans.

00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:57.130
If my pieces are worthless, then they're nothing but trouble.

00:17:57.470 --> 00:18:02.220
Hurry up and pick us up! You promised!

00:18:02.220 --> 00:18:06.140
You haven't fulfilled the terms of our agreement.

00:18:06.140 --> 00:18:07.900
The deal is off.

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:09.900
Wait!

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:12.020
Leon, what's going on?

00:18:12.020 --> 00:18:14.190
What did the Metarex say?

00:18:14.740 --> 00:18:16.820
No way...

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:18.610
Everyone, stop!

00:18:22.030 --> 00:18:26.410
Are you seriously going to surrender to the Metarex and abandon this planet?

00:18:26.410 --> 00:18:30.960
Our dream was to restore this planet!

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:32.210
I've had enough!

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:37.180
I'm sick of living on this piece of mud!

00:18:37.180 --> 00:18:39.090
I don't want to fight anymore!

00:18:39.090 --> 00:18:43.060
If we surrender to the Metarex, we won't have to die!

00:18:43.060 --> 00:18:47.770
Everyone isn't as strong as you, Molly.

00:18:48.640 --> 00:18:52.980
We're done! We don't want to die with this planet!

00:19:01.700 --> 00:19:03.490
Leave, Molly.

00:19:04.080 --> 00:19:05.370
Shadow...

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:09.870
You have a dream. You need to live so that you can fulfill it.

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:33.020
I...

00:19:34.900 --> 00:19:36.730
I'm not...

00:19:37.900 --> 00:19:39.820
I'm not that strong either...

00:19:51.710 --> 00:19:52.960
Molly!

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:13.900
Molly!

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:35.750
I admire your strength.

00:20:35.750 --> 00:20:37.960
You're like the Black Wind.

00:20:38.420 --> 00:20:42.680
Someone will carry on my dream.

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:36.810
Shadow, maybe Molly...

00:21:40.230 --> 00:21:42.860
Maybe she was similar to her.

00:21:42.860 --> 00:21:44.610
"Her"?

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:48.660
Or maybe not.

00:21:48.660 --> 00:21:51.160
She wasn't clinging to the past.

00:21:51.950 --> 00:21:56.120
She wanted to see the future.

00:22:05.510 --> 00:22:06.720
What?

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:09.100
Give that to the Doctor.

00:22:23.280 --> 00:22:27.610
Dr. Eggman, we're receiving a communication from someone.

00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:29.070
Put it on.

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:54.020
<i>私たちの世界は　魔法をかけられて</i>

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:54.020
<b>Watashitachi no sekai wa mahou o kakerarete</b>

00:22:44.630 --> 00:22:54.020
<i><i>There’s magic cast on our world.</i></i>

